# Runtime secrets must be mounted, never sent to a builder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/fire_auth_key*.json
**/service-account*.json
**/service_account*.json
**/credentials*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.aws
**/.azure
**/.ssh

# VCS, agent state, worktrees and local tools can contain credentials or stale artifacts.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.agent
**/.agents
**/.claude
**/.codex
**/.gemini
**/.superpowers
**/.codegraph
**/.worktrees
**/worktrees
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.history
**/.DS_Store
**/.gocache
**/gocache
**/__debug_bin*
**/miltechserver
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
frontend/build
.gen/.jetgen.lock
.gen/.jetgen-stage-*
.gen/**/*.jetgen-backup

# Keep .gen: the server must compile from the canonical tagged generated inputs.

# Ordinary root/nested logs and local scratch must never enter COPY . . layers.
**/*.log
**/logs
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/tmp
**/temp
**/scratch
